### Architecture Workflow

```text
Sensors
↓
Data Collection Layer
(simulator.py)
↓
CSV Storage
(sensor_data.csv)
↓
Analytics & Alert Engine
(alerts.py)
↓
Decision Logic
(Pump ON/OFF)
↓
Streamlit Dashboard
↓
Farmer/User
```

The architecture consists of sensor simulation, data processing, alert generation, and visualization layers.

