---

# 13. Conclusion

The IoT Smart Agriculture Monitoring System demonstrates how IoT technologies can improve agricultural practices through real-time monitoring, automation, and analytics. The system successfully simulates environmental monitoring, generates alerts, provides irrigation recommendations, and visualizes sensor data using a Streamlit dashboard. This project highlights the potential of IoT in achieving efficient and sustainable farming.

